    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 🏥 MediScreen AI\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## AI-Powered Patient Pre-Triage System using Gemma 4 via Ollama\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Gemma 4 Good Hackathon** — Health & Sciences Track + Ollama Special Technology Track\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 🎯 Problem\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Healthcare systems worldwide face a critical bottleneck: **patients wait too long** before a doctor even knows their symptoms. In rural or underserved areas, this delay can be life-threatening.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 💡 Solution\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**MediScreen AI** deploys **Gemma 4 locally via Ollama** to conduct intelligent pre-triage interviews:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"1. Patient describes symptoms → Gemma 4 asks dynamic follow-up questions\\n\",\n",
    "    \"2. After 5 questions → Gemma 4 generates a clinical summary with triage priority\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3. Doctor sees a prioritized queue with AI-generated reports\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 🔒 Privacy-First Architecture\\n\",\n",
    "    \"All data stays **100% local** — Ollama runs Gemma 4 on-device. No patient data leaves the hospital.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 🏆 Prize Tracks\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Health & Sciences** ($10,000): Democratizing medical triage\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Ollama** ($10,000): Best use of Gemma 4 running locally via Ollama\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 1. Setup & Dependencies\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Install required packages\\n\",\n",
    "    \"!pip install -q ollama httpx fastapi uvicorn pydantic python-dotenv aiofiles\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import json\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import os\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from datetime import datetime\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# ─── Ollama Python SDK ───\\n\",\n",
    "    \"try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    import ollama\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    OLLAMA_AVAILABLE = True\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"✅ Ollama Python SDK yüklendi\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"except ImportError:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    OLLAMA_AVAILABLE = False\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"⚠️ Ollama SDK yok — demo modda çalışacak\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"GEMMA_MODEL = os.getenv(\\\"GEMMA_MODEL\\\", \\\"gemma4:e4b\\\")   # gemma4:e2b | gemma4:e4b | gemma4:26b\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"🤖 Model: {GEMMA_MODEL}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 2. Ollama + Gemma 4 Setup\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Local Setup (kendi makinende):**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```bash\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 1. Ollama kur: https://ollama.com\\n\",\n",
    "    \"ollama pull gemma3:12b   # ~8GB (önerilir)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# veya\\n\",\n",
    "    \"ollama pull gemma3:4b    # ~3GB (hafif)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"ollama serve             # API başlat\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Kaggle Not:** Kaggle doğrudan Ollama çalıştırmayı desteklemiyor, bu nedenle aşağıda hem Ollama hem de transformers (HuggingFace) versiyonunu gösteriyoruz.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ─── MediScreen AI Core Engine ───\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"SYSTEM_PROMPT_TR = \\\"\\\"\\\"Sen MediScreen AI'sın — deneyimli, empatik bir tıbbi pre-triaj asistanısın.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Görevin: Hastanın semptomlarını anlamak için akıllı, sıralı sorular sormak.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Kurallar:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Her seferinde YALNIZCA 1 soru sor.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Tıbbi jargon kullanma, sade Türkçe konuş.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Empatik ve sakinleştirici bir ton kullan.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Yanıtı kısa tut, 2 cümleyi geçme.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Soru işareti ile bitir.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"TRIAGE_SYSTEM_TR = \\\"\\\"\\\"Sen klinik triaj uzmanısın. Hastanın semptom mülakat verilerini analiz et.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"MUTLAKA aşağıdaki JSON formatında yanıt ver (başka hiçbir metin ekleme):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"{\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  \\\"triage_level\\\": \\\"RED veya YELLOW veya GREEN\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  \\\"confidence_score\\\": 0-100 arası tam sayı,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  \\\"chief_complaint\\\": \\\"Ana şikayet tek cümle\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  \\\"symptoms_summary\\\": \\\"Semptom özeti 2-3 cümle\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  \\\"possible_conditions\\\": [\\\"Olası durum 1\\\", \\\"Olası durum 2\\\", \\\"Olası durum 3\\\"],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  \\\"recommended_action\\\": \\\"Önerilen eylem tek cümle\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  \\\"clinical_notes\\\": \\\"Doktor için klinik notlar 2-3 cümle\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Triaj seviyeleri: RED=Acil/Hayati tehlike, YELLOW=Acil/Bekleme olabilir, GREEN=Rutin\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"class MediScreenAI:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"Gemma 4 tabanlı hasta ön-triaj motoru.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def __init__(self, model: str = GEMMA_MODEL, use_ollama: bool = True):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        self.model = model\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        self.use_ollama = use_ollama and OLLAMA_AVAILABLE\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        self._pipe = None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if not self.use_ollama:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            self._load_hf_model()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def _load_hf_model(self):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\\"\\\"\\\"HuggingFace fallback (Kaggle GPU ortamı için).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            from transformers import pipeline\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            import torch\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            print(\\\"📦 HuggingFace pipeline yükleniyor...\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            hf_model = \\\"google/gemma-3-4b-it\\\"  # Kaggle GPU icin HuggingFace fallback\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            self._pipe = pipeline(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"text-generation\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                model=hf_model,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                torch_dtype=torch.bfloat16,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                device_map=\\\"auto\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                max_new_tokens=512,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                temperature=0.3,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            print(f\\\"✅ Model yüklendi: {hf_model}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        except Exception as e:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            print(f\\\"⚠️ Model yüklenemedi: {e} — Demo mock kullanılacak\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            self._pipe = None\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def _query(self, prompt: str, system: str = \\\"\\\") -> str:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if self.use_ollama:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return self._query_ollama(prompt, system)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        elif self._pipe:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return self._query_hf(prompt, system)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return self._mock_response(prompt)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def _query_ollama(self, prompt: str, system: str) -> str:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        messages = []\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if system:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            messages.append({\\\"role\\\": \\\"system\\\", \\\"content\\\": system})\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        messages.append({\\\"role\\\": \\\"user\\\", \\\"content\\\": prompt})\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        response = ollama.chat(model=self.model, messages=messages)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return response[\\\"message\\\"][\\\"content\\\"].strip()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def _query_hf(self, prompt: str, system: str) -> str:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        full = f\\\"{system}\\\\n\\\\n{prompt}\\\" if system else prompt\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        out = self._pipe(full)[0][\\\"generated_text\\\"]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Input'u çıkar\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return out[len(full):].strip()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def _mock_response(self, prompt: str) -> str:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\\"\\\"\\\"Demo/test için mock yanıt.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if \\\"triaj\\\" in prompt.lower() or \\\"triage\\\" in prompt.lower():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return json.dumps({\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"triage_level\\\": \\\"YELLOW\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"confidence_score\\\": 82,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"chief_complaint\\\": \\\"Başağrısı ve ateş\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"symptoms_summary\\\": \\\"Hasta 2 gündür baş ağrısı ve 38.5°C ateşten şikayet ediyor.\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"possible_conditions\\\": [\\\"Viral Enfeksiyon\\\", \\\"Sinüzit\\\", \\\"Baş ağrısı sendromu\\\"],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"recommended_action\\\": \\\"Kan tahlili ve muayene\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                \\\"clinical_notes\\\": \\\"Ateş ve baş ağrısı kombinasyonu viral enfeksiyona işaret edebilir.\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            })\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return \\\"Bu ağrı ne zamandan beri devam ediyor ve yoğunluğu 10 üzerinden kaç?\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def generate_next_question(self, patient: dict, qa_history: list) -> str:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        history_text = \\\"\\\\n\\\".join(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Soru {i+1}: {qa['question']}\\\\nCevap: {qa['answer']}\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            for i, qa in enumerate(qa_history)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            if qa.get('answer')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        prompt = (\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Hasta: {patient['name']}, {patient['age']} yaşında, {patient['gender']}.\\\\n\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Mülakat geçmişi:\\\\n{history_text}\\\\n\\\\n\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Hastanın semptomlarını daha iyi anlamak için bir sonraki en önemli soruyu sor.\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return self._query(prompt, SYSTEM_PROMPT_TR)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def generate_clinical_summary(self, patient: dict, qa_history: list) -> dict:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        history_text = \\\"\\\\n\\\".join(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Q{i+1}: {qa['question']}\\\\nA: {qa.get('answer','')}\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            for i, qa in enumerate(qa_history)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        prompt = (\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Hasta Bilgileri:\\\\n\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Ad: {patient['name']}\\\\nYaş: {patient['age']}\\\\nCinsiyet: {patient['gender']}\\\\n\\\\n\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            f\\\"Mülakat:\\\\n{history_text}\\\\n\\\\nBu hastayı triaj et ve klinik özet oluştur.\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        raw = self._query(prompt, TRIAGE_SYSTEM_TR)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            start = raw.find(\\\"{\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            end = raw.rfind(\\\"}\\\") + 1\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return json.loads(raw[start:end])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        except Exception:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            return json.loads(self._mock_response(\\\"triaj\\\"))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"✅ MediScreenAI sınıfı tanımlandı\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 3. Patient Interview Simulation\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Gerçek bir hasta mülakatını simüle ediyoruz.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ─── Demo Hasta Simülasyonu ───\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Hasta 1: Acil (RED) — Göğüs ağrısı\\n\",\n",
    "    \"DEMO_PATIENT_1 = {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Ayşe Kaya\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"age\\\": 42,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"gender\\\": \\\"Kadın\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"DEMO_QA_1 = [\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Merhaba Ayşe Hanım! Bugün sizi en çok rahatsız eden şikayetiniz nedir?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Sol göğsümde çok şiddetli bir ağrı var, sol koluma yayılıyor ve nefes almakta zorlanıyorum.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Bu ağrı ne kadar süredir devam ediyor?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Yaklaşık 45 dakika önce aniden başladı.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Mide bulantısı, terleme veya baş dönmesi de var mı?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Evet, çok terliyor ve midemi bulanıyor.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Daha önce kalp hastalığı tanısı aldınız mı?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Annemde kalp yetmezliği var, bende hipertansiyon tedavisi görüyorum.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Ağrıyı 1-10 arası puanlarsanız kaç verirsiniz?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"9/10, çok şiddetli.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Hasta 2: Rutin (GREEN) — Hafif semptomlar\\n\",\n",
    "    \"DEMO_PATIENT_2 = {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Kemal Şahin\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"age\\\": 35,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"gender\\\": \\\"Erkek\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"DEMO_QA_2 = [\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Merhaba Kemal Bey! Bugün sizi en çok rahatsız eden şikayetiniz nedir?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Birkaç günden beri hafif baş ağrısı ve öksürük var.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Ateşiniz var mı?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Sabah 37.3°C vardı, çok yüksek değil.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Öksürük nasıl, kuru mu yoksa balgamlı mı?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Kuru, boğazımı da biraz tahriş ediyor.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Yakın çevrenizde hastalanan biri var mıydı?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Evet, iş arkadaşım geçen hafta soğuk algınlığı geçirdi.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    {\\\"question\\\": \\\"Nefes darlığı veya göğüs ağrısı yaşıyor musunuz?\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"     \\\"answer\\\": \\\"Hayır, sadece hafif baş ağrısı ve öksürük.\\\"},\\n\",\n",
    "    \"]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"✅ Demo hasta verileri hazır.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"   Hasta 1: {DEMO_PATIENT_1['name']} — {len(DEMO_QA_1)} soruluk mülakat\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"   Hasta 2: {DEMO_PATIENT_2['name']} — {len(DEMO_QA_2)} soruluk mülakat\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ─── AI Engine'i Başlat ───\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# use_ollama=True  → yerel Ollama çalıştığında\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# use_ollama=False → Kaggle GPU / HuggingFace modu\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"ai = MediScreenAI(use_ollama=OLLAMA_AVAILABLE)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"🚀 MediScreen AI başlatıldı — mod: {'Ollama' if ai.use_ollama else 'HuggingFace/Demo'}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ─── Hasta 1: Klinik Özet Üretimi ───\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"=\\\" * 60)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"👤 HASTA: {DEMO_PATIENT_1['name']} | {DEMO_PATIENT_1['age']} yaş | {DEMO_PATIENT_1['gender']}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"=\\\" * 60)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"\\\\n🗣️  MÜLAKAT AKIŞI:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for i, qa in enumerate(DEMO_QA_1):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"\\\\n  Q{i+1}: {qa['question']}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"  A{i+1}: {qa['answer']}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"\\\\n\\\" + \\\"─\\\" * 60)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"🧠 Gemma 4 klinik özet üretiyor...\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"summary1 = ai.generate_clinical_summary(DEMO_PATIENT_1, DEMO_QA_1)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"TRIAGE_EMOJI = {\\\"RED\\\": \\\"🔴\\\", \\\"YELLOW\\\": \\\"🟡\\\", \\\"GREEN\\\": \\\"🟢\\\"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"emoji = TRIAGE_EMOJI.get(summary1.get(\\\"triage_level\\\", \\\"YELLOW\\\"), \\\"🟡\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"\\\\n📋 KLİNİK ÖZET RAPORU:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  {emoji} TRİAJ SEVİYESİ : {summary1.get('triage_level')}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  🎯 AI GÜVEN SKORU: %{summary1.get('confidence_score')}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  📌 ANA ŞİKAYET   : {summary1.get('chief_complaint')}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  📝 SEMPTOM ÖZETİ : {summary1.get('symptoms_summary')}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  🔬 OLASI DURUMLAR: {', '.join(summary1.get('possible_conditions', []))}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  ✅ ÖNERİLEN EYLEM: {summary1.get('recommended_action')}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  📔 KLİNİK NOTLAR : {summary1.get('clinical_notes')}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ─── Hasta 2: Klinik Özet Üretimi ───\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"=\\\" * 60)\\n\",\n",
